@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
actor "CLI user" as User
participant "search CLI" as CLI
participant "REST API" as API
participant IndexService as Index
participant SearchPipeline as Pipeline
participant OllamaClient as LLM
participant Ollama
participant SearchEngine as Engine
User -> CLI : search "coral reef"
CLI -> API : POST /api/search {query, mode: keyword}
API -> Index : Snapshot()
Index --> API : shared_ptr<const InvertedIndex>
API -> Pipeline : Run(snapshot, query)
Pipeline -> LLM : ExpandQuery(query, model)
LLM -> Ollama : POST /api/generate
alt response before total deadline
  Ollama --> LLM : keywords / synonyms
  LLM --> Pipeline : normalized unique terms
else unavailable / timeout / invalid response
  LLM --> Pipeline : empty terms (original query retained)
end
Pipeline -> Engine : Search(index, original + expanded terms)
Engine --> Pipeline : ranked hits + snippets
Pipeline --> API : SearchOutcome
API --> CLI : JSON {results, time_ms}
CLI --> User : doc_id, score, snippet (or --json)
@enduml
